and finally $C_f$ is in series with $C_1$ and $C_{10}$ and give

\begin{aligned}
& \frac{1}{C_{\mathrm{cq}}}=\frac{1}{3}+\frac{1}{3}+\frac{1}{3}=\frac{3}{3}=1 \\
